Package: xfce4-appfinder
Version: @DEB_XFCE4APPFINDER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libxfce4util7, libxfce4ui-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, xfconf
Description: Application finder/launcher for the Xfce desktop environment
 xfce4-appfinder searches and launches installed applications from a simple
 type-to-find dialog -- the primary way to launch apps with the iOS keyboard.
